<p>The site includes theories of consciousness developed not just in philosophy and cognitive science but neuroscience, psychology, computing, biology, physics, anthropology, theology, &#8220;spirituality,&#8221; and indigenous traditions. You can create lists of the theories sorted by discipline, historical period, and geography.</p>
